{"id":"d8ad50b1bb4a4cb1","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-decision-ackermann.md","title":"Ackermann","display":"thm-decision-ackermann — Ackermann","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-decision-ackermann","aliases":["57-thm-decision-ackermann"],"display":"thm-decision-ackermann — Ackermann","depends_on":["[[57-df-decidable-theory]]","[[57-df-maxcon]]","[[57-df-satisfiable]]","[[57-df-formula]]","[[57-df-godel-numbering]]","[[57-df-prenex]]","[[57-df-quantifier-free]]","[[57-df-arith0]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-decision-ackermann"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-decision-ackermann</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-decision-ackermann — Ackermann"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4107e891ce817208\" href=\"?note=4107e891ce817208\" title=\"57-df-decidable-theory\">57-df-decidable-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e892c7a9bb01feb5\" href=\"?note=e892c7a9bb01feb5\" title=\"57-df-maxcon\">57-df-maxcon</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"befcfc958ddf5dbd\" href=\"?note=befcfc958ddf5dbd\" title=\"57-df-satisfiable\">57-df-satisfiable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"373da07803c26744\" href=\"?note=373da07803c26744\" title=\"57-df-godel-numbering\">57-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c26c22b49d5bbbe4\" href=\"?note=c26c22b49d5bbbe4\" title=\"57-df-prenex\">57-df-prenex</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6e2653d41c62cb0e\" href=\"?note=6e2653d41c62cb0e\" title=\"57-df-quantifier-free\">57-df-quantifier-free</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ffb90a5e7b76ea84\" href=\"?note=ffb90a5e7b76ea84\" title=\"57-df-arith0\">57-df-arith0</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是有效的有限纯关系语言：无常量、正元函数及零元关系符号；允许逻辑等号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"373da07803c26744\" href=\"?note=373da07803c26744\" title=\"57-df-godel-numbering\">57-df-godel-numbering</a> 的有效语法编码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pref}\">\\(\\mathrm{Pref}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"c26c22b49d5bbbe4\" href=\"?note=c26c22b49d5bbbe4\" title=\"57-df-prenex\">57-df-prenex</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QF}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{QF}_S\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"6e2653d41c62cb0e\" href=\"?note=6e2653d41c62cb0e\" title=\"57-df-quantifier-free\">57-df-quantifier-free</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}(\\{\\sigma\\})\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}(\\{\\sigma\\})\\)</span> 是该单句的可满足性。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dec}_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathrm{Dec}_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 是数集可判定类，不是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"4107e891ce817208\" href=\"?note=4107e891ce817208\" title=\"57-df-decidable-theory\">57-df-decidable-theory</a> 的理论类 Dec；其与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span> 的关系在下式明示。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AckSent}_S\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{Pref}(\\langle(\\exists,x_1),\\ldots,(\\exists,x_m),(\\forall,y),(\\exists,z_1),\\ldots,(\\exists,z_n)\\rangle,\\theta):m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{QF}_S\\land\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_m,y,z_1,\\ldots,z_n\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{m+n+1}\\land|\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_m,y,z_1,\\ldots,z_n\\}|=m+n+1\\land\\mathrm{free}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_m,y,z_1,\\ldots,z_n\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{AckSent}_S\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{Pref}(\\langle(\\exists,x_1),\\ldots,(\\exists,x_m),(\\forall,y),(\\exists,z_1),\\ldots,(\\exists,z_n)\\rangle,\\theta):m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{QF}_S\\land\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_m,y,z_1,\\ldots,z_n\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{m+n+1}\\land|\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_m,y,z_1,\\ldots,z_n\\}|=m+n+1\\land\\mathrm{free}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_m,y,z_1,\\ldots,z_n\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SatCode}_{\\operatorname{Ack},g}\\coloneqq\\{g(\\sigma):\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{AckSent}_S\\land\\mathrm{Sat}(\\{\\sigma\\})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SatCode}_{\\operatorname{Ack},g}\\coloneqq\\{g(\\sigma):\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{AckSent}_S\\land\\mathrm{Sat}(\\{\\sigma\\})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dec}_{\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:A\\in\\mathrm{Rec}\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{SatCode}_{\\operatorname{Ack},g}\\in\\mathrm{Dec}_{\\mathbb N}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Dec}_{\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:A\\in\\mathrm{Rec}\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{SatCode}_{\\operatorname{Ack},g}\\in\\mathrm{Dec}_{\\mathbb N}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原式把整个片段的可满足性谓词值当成可判定理论。这里断言其单句可满足性的编码集可判定，并完整给出前缀类和有效语言条件；保留可含等号的 Ackermann 片段。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-decidable-theory","status":"resolved","id":"4107e891ce817208","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-decidable-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-maxcon","status":"resolved","id":"e892c7a9bb01feb5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-maxcon]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-satisfiable","status":"resolved","id":"befcfc958ddf5dbd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-satisfiable]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"373da07803c26744","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-prenex","status":"resolved","id":"c26c22b49d5bbbe4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-prenex]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-quantifier-free","status":"resolved","id":"6e2653d41c62cb0e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-quantifier-free]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-arith0","status":"resolved","id":"ffb90a5e7b76ea84","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-arith0]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"373da07803c26744","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 是有效的有限纯关系语言：无常量、